  "name": "Welcome Email",
  "response": "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Dear Parents of {{first_name}},</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Congratulations! We are pleased to let you know that your child {{first_name}} has been accepted into Walnut School! You are now an integral part of the Walnut Family and also our brand ambassador.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Walnut Schools are progressive in every possible way. We have a very balanced learning and co-curricular system, due to which we can have many awesome features in addition to&nbsp;extra-curricular activities, subject-wise classrooms, and of course, the feature which we all love - NO school bag!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Your Next Steps:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">We request you to please check your registered email address for an email which we\u2019ve sent, that has *very* important information about Walnut School, and what you have to do before school starts.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">We welcome you once again to the Walnut family and look forward to fruitful and exciting years ahead.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Warm Regards,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">The Walnut School Administration Team.</span></p></div>",
