hat you are paying</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">The total installment amount payable and the bifurcation</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">Total discount given (if any : related to installments, referral, staff etc.) and late fee charges (if any)</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">You will see options for payment mode that you can select. e.g. Net-banking, UPI, Credit cards and Debit Card</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">If you have any issues with the link above, please copy the link text below and paste it in your browser to initiate payment</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">{{templink}}</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">After that, you will receive an OTP on the mobile number that is registered with the school. You will have to enter that OTP to proceed with the payment. </span></p></div>",
